# 🌊 Undertow by Underground Incorporated

**Undertow** is a dark and atmospheric adventure game inspired by *Dredge*, developed by **Luca Cocchia** and **Underground Incorporated**. Explore treacherous waters, uncover hidden mysteries, and manage your vessel while facing the unknown lurking beneath the waves.

## ⚓ Features
- **🌍 Open-Ocean Exploration** – Navigate vast, uncharted waters filled with secrets and dangers.
- **🌧️ Dynamic Weather & Time System** – Adapt to ever-changing conditions that affect navigation and visibility.
- **🕵️ Mysterious Storyline** – Piece together the eerie history of the ocean and its forgotten depths.
- **🎣 Fishing & Resource Management** – Catch fish, trade, and upgrade your vessel to survive.
- **👁️ Cosmic Horror Elements** – Encounter unsettling phenomena and creatures beyond comprehension.

## 🛠 Installation & Setup
Wishlist it on steam.
